#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:52
#: b5fdb239162b4b22b56ede227bfc51f9
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:54
#: aae54f8b19254ff482635a0af6d6c6b6
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART2 RX input. It supports all "
"unidirectional RC protocols except PPM. FPort and full duplex protocols, "
"like CRSF/ELRS, will need to use TX2 also."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认通过 USART2 的 RX 引脚配置。支持除 PPM 外的所有单向 RC 协议。FPort 与 CRSF/ELRS "
"等全双工协议还需同时使用 TX2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:56
#: 93828890f7c94e9bb102563b7e4ca24e
msgid ""
"If the receiver is FPort or a full duplex protocol, then the receiver must "
"be tied to the USART2 TX pin and `SERIAL2_OPTIONS "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#serial2-options>`_ = 7 "
"(invert TX/RX, half duplex), and `RSSI_TYPE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#rssi-type>`_ =3."
msgstr ""
"如果接收机使用 FPort 或全双工协议，则接收机必须连接到 USART2 的 TX 引脚，并设置 `SERIAL2_OPTIONS "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#serial2-options>`_ = 7（反转"
" TX/RX，半双工），以及 `RSSI_TYPE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#rssi-type>`_ = 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:59
#: 22981e5b09a043148f613b56472ce79a
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 遥测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:61
#: 4decfe3235084dcca8a0be6cf417f4f2
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART. You need to set "
"the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT (example shows "
"SERIAL3)."
msgstr ""
"使用任何 UART 的 Tx 引脚支持 FrSky 数传。要启用对 FrSky S.PORT 的支持（示例使用 SERIAL3），需要设置以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:64
#: 3e7c4931f68f4ef493100d88fb3f6e76
msgid "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"
msgstr "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:65
#: c51bf73ce099469cb9b38ba9fcc7112e
msgid "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"
msgstr "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:68
#: ab16dc803ebb489a9513a4a8cc87ba8a
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:70
#: 52c134259c0f4edf913ed8f84ef9eb4b
msgid ""
"The TAKER F745 BT supports analog OSD using its internal OSD chip and "
"simultaneously HD goggle DisplayPort OSDs via the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"TAKER F745 BT 通过其内部 OSD 芯片支持模拟 OSD，同时通过 HD VTX 连接器支持 HD 护目镜 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:73
#: 5b149e6488a54ec69a6a61d7a6851966
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "VTX 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:75
#: 29006fd0af204300887223922caf6768
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 12v (or VBAT by solder pad selection) so be careful not to "
"connect to devices expecting 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 连接器支持标准 DJI HD VTX 连接。连接器的第 1 引脚为 12V（或通过焊盘选择的 VBAT），请注意不要连接到期望 5V "
"的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:78
#: bcd0e8a00a3b4e15928b076380350cd5
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:80
#: 714ad79103284588b48ecff3170fa340
msgid ""
"The TAKER F745 BT supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1"
" to M4 are on the esc connector, M5-M8 are solder pads, plus M9 is defaulted"
" for serial LED strip or can be used as another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"TAKER F745 BT 支持最多 9 路 PWM 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 的焊盘在 ESC 连接器上，M5-M8 是焊盘，M9 默认用于串行"
" LED 灯带或可用作另一路 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:83
#: eff14583b3b347fdbe786eec56606f6c
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:86
#: e279e1786c574e9d911174abdf723112
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:87
#: a9d443f98a1f44f8b5c4bdfdf6ec55ad
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:88
#: a84646c9c32342a890d457384c23d81e
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:89
#: e306cb86673645239c2900e76badb332
msgid "PWM 9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:91
#: a40c4b952f2c4dbab338c7f6f7312fae
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道需要使用相同的输出速率。如果组内任何通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1-4 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:96
#: 7cb2d4a6090d4d51bd08638925d90f35
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:98
#: 18e6fb5b3bd04c0a9169c7f6f65b10ab
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "飞控板有内部电压传感器，并在 ESC 连接器上有外部电流传感器输入的连接。电压传感器可处理高达 6S 的锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:100
#: 25016a88b83a40568385c832d5655548
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:103
#: 95211b465eb34018b06879f673c3ff6f
msgid "BATT_MONITOR 4"
msgstr "BATT_MONITOR 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:104
#: 51a61071ae234bd6ae36d3330ce85258
msgid "BATT_VOLT_PIN 13"
msgstr "BATT_VOLT_PIN 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:105
#: 9df03d9503f840b4a893687acc44dd2a
msgid "BATT_VOLT_SCALE 11.0"
msgstr "BATT_VOLT_SCALE 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:106
#: 5d115701f80f49dba0b8aaf26c918d95
msgid "BATT_CURR_PIN 12"
msgstr "BATT_CURR_PIN 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:107
#: 3f38f1986df6447b837bd43b7f271b53
