msgstr "BATT_CURR_SCALE 28.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:110
#: a8418224dc3741ee848fe48fb3155f76
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:112
#: 1aaf1fe22fe14f36b4f4c8f71f9c33c9
msgid ""
"The TAKER F745 BT does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "TAKER F745 BT 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:115
#: 6e45377ad68844098c933c952d5964e6
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:117
#: d9c599bc23ff425e993670af55bab01f
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件可以通过按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 的 DFU 方式加载。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:121
#: 84349609a06848d189948ffa42e9fe97
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载后，可以使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
